$ todo add -p 1 buy milk
  add "buy milk" with priority 1
$ todo list --all
  list, including done: true
$ todo done 7
  close item 7
$ todo -h list
  help requested for todo list
$ todo remove 7
  error at argument 0: unknown child command
$ todo add -p soon x
  error at argument -1: --priority: expected an integer
Usage: todo [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>
A to-do list

Options:
  --help, -h
    Show this help

Commands:
  add
    Add an item
  list
    Show items
  done
    Close an item
